{"created": "2025-06-17T16:40:24.455453+00:00", "modified": "2025-06-17T16:40:24.997358+00:00", "id": 15683784, "conceptrecid": "10966280", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.15683784", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.10966280", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.15683784", "metadata": {"title": "MsnLib multi-stage fragmentation mass spectral libraries  - mzml positive and negative", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.15683784", "publication_date": "2025-06-17", "description": "<p>The data for <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv-2024-l1tqh-v2\">MSnLib</a> are divided into several Zenodo records due to size constraints.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>raw positive: <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.10966404\">10966404</a><br>raw negative: <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.10967081\">10967081</a><br>mzml positive and negative: <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.10966280\">10966280</a><br>spectral libraries: <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.11163380\">11163380</a></p>\n<p>This record includes zipped files containing the converted mzml positive and negative data, acquired using a flow injection method on an Orbitrap ID-X instrument, for all compound libraries. The different polartities are kept separated.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>9 Compound Libraries:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Short Name: Full name, Provider (Catalog number), total compounds (not all detected during library building)</li>\n<li>MCEBIO: Bioactive Compound Library, MedChemExpress (HY-L001), 10,315 compounds</li>\n<li>MCESAF: 5k Scaffold Library, MedChemExpress, (HY-L902), 4998 compounds</li>\n<li>NIHNP: NIH NPAC ACONN collection of NP, NIH/NCATS, 3988 compounds</li>\n<li>OTAVAPEP: Alpha-helix Peptiomimetic Library, OTAVAchemicals (a-helix-Peptido), 1298 compounds</li>\n<li>ENAMDISC: Discovery Diversity Set -10, Enamine (DDS-10), 10,240 compounds</li>\n<li>ENAMMOL: Carboxylic Acid Fragment Library + Random, Enamine and Molport, 4378 compounds</li>\n<li>MCEDRUG: FDA-Approved Drug Library, MedChemExpress (HY-L022), 2610 compounds</li>\n<li>MCEDIV_50k_Sub: Subset of 50K Diversity Library, MedChemExpress (HY-L901), 20000 compounds</li>\n<li>TargetMolNPHTS: Subset of Natural Product Library for HTS, TargetMol (L6000), 2175 compounds</li>\n</ul>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Brungs, Corinna", "affiliation": "Czech Academy of Sciences, Institute of Organic Chemistry and Biochemistry", "orcid": "0000-0002-2571-5235"}, {"name": "Schmid, Robin", "affiliation": "Czech Academy of Sciences, Institute of Organic Chemistry and Biochemistry"}, {"name": "Pluskal, Tomas", "affiliation": "Czech Academy of Sciences, Institute of Organic Chemistry and Biochemistry"}], "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 4, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "10966280"}}]}}, "title": "MsnLib multi-stage fragmentation mass spectral libraries  - mzml positive and negative", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/15683784", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/15683784", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/15683784?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.15683784", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.15683784", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.15683784", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/15683784/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10966280", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/10966280", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.10966280", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.10966280", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:15683784/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:15683784/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/15683784/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/15683784/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/15683784/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://z